# State of an excitation module for its drive (docs/system_plan.md, section
# 5.2.1), at the rate of the commands. The drive takes the measured field
# current as the field flux of its observer and its torque constant.
#
# Payload 5 bytes, one CAN FD frame.
#
# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

float16 field_current
# Measured field current [A].

float16 field_voltage
# Mean voltage the module applies to the field winding [V].

bool enabled
# The field current loop runs (the last command enabled it).

bool fault
# The module switched its output off (overcurrent, overtemperature, lost
# commands); latched until the drive sends enable = false.

@extent 63 * 8
